About us, minus the corporate intro
We’re a digital-first agency and we’re looking for a Social Media Manager who gets the internet, understands brands, knows their way around data, and isn’t afraid to bring a slightly crazy idea to the table when everyone else is playing it safe.
So, what would you actually do?
directly manage the social media accounts allocated
supervise the content production for the social media channels of our clients (strategic approach, planning, and briefing of dedicated resources in charge of this development);
Together with the social media team, handle influencer management: identify& work with influencers to amplify campaigns;
Reporting & Analysis: identify insights from reports, generate key learnings;
Drive optimization: monitor performance and refocus if needed
Create native content when needed (in our agency or at specific locations)
What do you need for the job?
Work experience: minimum 2 years of social media management in an advertising agency;
Good project management skills, as well as written and verbal communication skills;
Organised, data-driven thinker, collaborative by nature;
Passionate about emerging Social Platforms and willing to try new things, take risks.
Experience with various publishing and monitoring tools (reporting, listening, publishing, Facebook and Google advertising platforms) is considered a plus.
We’re not looking for someone who just keeps the content calendar alive.
We’re looking for someone who has opinions, ideas and curiosity, who can challenge a brief when needed and who wants to make brands actually relevant in social.
If that sounds like you, let’s talk.
